##This is my first project back

Problem Statement: 
    I want a application to keep track of all my trading and investments
    at a glance

Libraries used:
    pandas (For working with labeled data efficiently)
    yfinance (For financial and market data from Yahoo Finance)
    streamlit (Turns python scripts into interactive webapps)
    numpy (For mathematical functions)
    scipy (For scientific and numerical computation tools)
